    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847780/extras/25fde9e61101d16ff7fcbba957dac282.poster.avif?t=1753878159\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847780/extras/25fde9e61101d16ff7fcbba957dac282.webm?t=1753878159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847780/extras/25fde9e61101d16ff7fcbba957dac282.mp4?t=1753878159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nocturnal 2</strong> is an action-adventure game that lets you explore and rekindle the dark depths and towering heights of the city of Ytash.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken a city by gradually clearing its shadowed halls and spreading fire throughout its quarters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your map to track every fire source and uncover what must be rekindled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a fast, flexible character built for smooth and expressive movement and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a compact island focused on a singular gameplay concept, filled with secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your experience with extensive options: full control remapping, camera shake toggle, controller vibration, colorblind modes, widescreen support, accessibility settings, and more.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847780/extras/25fde9e61101d16ff7fcbba957dac282.poster.avif?t=1753878159\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847780/extras/25fde9e61101d16ff7fcbba957dac282.webm?t=1753878159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847780/extras/25fde9e61101d16ff7fcbba957dac282.mp4?t=1753878159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nocturnal 2</strong> is an action-adventure game that lets you explore and rekindle the dark depths and towering heights of the city of Ytash.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken a city by gradually clearing its shadowed halls and spreading fire throughout its quarters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your map to track every fire source and uncover what must be rekindled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a fast, flexible character built for smooth and expressive movement and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a compact island focused on a singular gameplay concept, filled with secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your experience with extensive options: full control remapping, camera shake toggle, controller vibration, colorblind modes, widescreen support, accessibility settings, and more.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Ignite your sword and explore the dark depths and towering heights of a forgotten island that consumed itself long ago.",
